{"sections":[{"id":"noi-dung","title":"Nội dung hướng dẫn","paragraphs":[],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-172962","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Intro:","bold":true},{"text":" "},{"text":"Celestial Realm","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/story:celestial-realm-a-theft-of-light"},{"text":", save the Celestial Realm from the invading Infernals ("},{"text":"/join celestialrealm","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/celestial-realm"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-173065","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Chap 1:","bold":true},{"text":" "},{"text":"Journey through the portal and help Aranx save the Celestial Avatars of Time, Death, and Life ("},{"text":"/join lostruins","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/lost-ruins"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-173188","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Chap 2:","bold":true},{"text":" "},{"text":"The avatars have been freed, but the Infernal Invasion has begun! ("},{"text":"/join lostruinswar","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/lost-ruins-war"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-173286","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Chap 3.1:","bold":true},{"text":" "},{"text":"Celestial Realm: A Theft Of Light","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/story:celestial-realm-a-theft-of-light"},{"text":", where Aranx's Celestial Realm is invaded by the Infernal Army ("},{"text":"/join infernalspire","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/infernal-spire"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-173418","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Chap 3.2:","bold":true},{"text":" "},{"text":"The Infernal Army has invaded the Celestial Realm.. to what end? ("},{"text":"/join dreadrock","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/dreadrock-citadel"},{"text":" & "},{"text":"/join spirepast","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/spire-past"},{"text":")\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-173531","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Chap 4:","bold":true},{"text":" Battle through a succession of pocket dimensions as you search for Arthelyn, the ruler of the Celestial Realm. Find her, and we save the Realm… for Good! ("},{"text":"/join pocketdimension","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/pocket-dimension"},{"text":", "},{"text":"/join icedimension","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/ice-dimension"},{"text":", "},{"text":"/join sanddimension","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/sand-dimension"},{"text":", "},{"text":"/join darkdimension","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/dark-dimension"},{"text":" & "},{"text":"/join ivoliss","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/ivoliss-location"},{"text":")"},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-173797","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Chap 5:","bold":true},{"text":" "},{"text":"Battle through the past to help Aranx reveal more about the realm guardians... and a coming Darkness ("},{"text":"/join celestialpast","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/celestial-past"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-173931","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Chap 6.1:","bold":true},{"text":" After 10 years and many invasions, the final confrontation against Azalith, fallen Infernal Archangel is here ("},{"text":"/join infernalparadise","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/infernal-paradise"},{"text":")."},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-174079","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Chap 6.2:","bold":true},{"text":" Survive and you'll discover the secret of the Celestial Realm's creation and the fate of Aranx's family ("},{"text":"/join infernaldianoia","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/infernal-dianoia"},{"text":")."},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-174221","runs":[{"text":"Challenge Arenas","bold":true},{"text":" "},{"text":"(không liên quan đến truyến truyện)","italic":true},{"text":":\n","bold":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-174275","runs":[{"text":"→ Battle your way through the Celestial Arena. But beware… all fights are down to you alone! No friends can help you in these battles. ("},{"text":"/join celestialarena","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/celestial-arena"},{"t